      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a strong start. When you talk about the area being a \"blight\" and a \"relic,\" can you expand on that a bit? Specifically, when we're presenting this to the more conservative members of the council, how should we describe the social dynamics and the 'vibe' of the current residents to help them understand why the current demographic isn't attracting the high-end developers we're looking for?",
